&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; text-align: center; text-indent: -60px"&gt;各本社債の額面金額&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; width: 88px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 7.2px; padding-right: 7.2px; border-left: 0px none ; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 108px; text-align: center; text-indent: -60px"&gt;×&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; width: 224px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 7.2px; padding-right: 7.2px; border-left: 0px none ; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 108px; text-align: left; text-indent: -60px"&gt;１株当たり平均VWAP&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 32.07px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 160px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 7.2px; padding-right: 7.2px; border-left: 0px none ; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; text-align: center; text-indent: -60px"&gt;最終日転換価額&lt;/p&gt;
